### API
### OK All users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/

### OK User by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/693ac65228077994449a00dd

### OK User by username
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/username/Sara%20Neri

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gabriella",
  "userId": 77,
  "age": 67
}


### Update user by ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/693ac65228077994449a00dd
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 67
}


### Delete user by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/693ac65228077994449a00dd

